{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "18d1a8d7a7b82068c2198bce47a54d12fe0d27ddd1316dd109787252d6900fdc", "ja": "（冬祭りの最後を飾るライブが終わった。\nステージを降りた海美が、駆け戻ってくる……）", "zh": "（冬祭压轴的演唱会结束了。\n海美走下舞台，跑了回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "80dc25995477599dc1c57299a8d76d4659fa032762674dc01025586b66a0a83a", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}！\n楽しかったーっ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n好开心喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4879b9df186c31aad9e9ecd0b1fd1c60a30a2488dbba13189477101a651db3bb", "ja": "お疲れさま、海美！\nああ、すごくキラキラしてたな。", "zh": "你也辛苦了，海美！\n是啊，真的非常耀眼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "b497a55a23f489d0813117c115b5672ba91fe03452c09aca30a84c7dd53e03dd", "ja": "うんうん♪　雪のステージ、綺麗だったよね！\nライトアップでキラキラしてて……。", "zh": "对啊对啊♪白雪舞台好漂亮喔！\n在灯光下好耀眼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "4302f31d2546b37d93c88de72d9d4a479a376665408211f285e99c500c7224e3", "ja": "照明の光が雪みたいに、ふわふわ、ひらひら～って！\n{$P$}も、見てたでしょ？", "zh": "照明的灯光就像是雪一样，轻飘飘又翩翩起舞～～！\n{$P$}，你也有看到吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e832a6d8519138d0d8ca252e059dc22e42a7b1952718b65697e6a7779b6eabb0", "ja": "ああ、綺麗だったな！　……というか、\n今のは海美を褒めたつもりだったんだけど……。", "zh": "有啊，很漂亮！\n……不过，其实我刚刚是在夸奖海美你啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "34dcf919870829d518bfce2cc2d9e277e1e999eddf81a9358fd5af755e37477a", "ja": "へっ？　私を褒めた？　……何が？", "zh": "我？夸奖我……夸奖我什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6d29958d941ecc704ff59a2baa527636288253e651436f5a56b8d8899415fc8f", "ja": "いや、だから。ステージだけじゃなくて、\n海美自身が、すごくキラキラしてたって事だよ。", "zh": "不是，我是说不光只是舞台，\n海美，你自己也非常地耀眼喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "62ef7480250180d8582276e5ccecc9026966b809b34c86a3ccb6f0b9236f025f", "ja": "えっ……ええーーーーーっ！！？", "zh": "咦……咦咦──────！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e5936c07d41fe67a982ce3ae27f42251fa528704241fc60710ecac961020eeb2", "ja": "そんなに驚かなくても……。", "zh": "你也不用这么惊讶吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "decadd5ecd96a3d126797112eb893381a3b891ac9d94df21b538832273650d3d", "ja": "だ、だってだって！\n{$P$}が変なコト言うから～！", "zh": "可、可是可是！\n{$P$}，你讲的话好奇怪～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0b44e59a61b30effefb71c32177f8f7472d23f900216a52895e16a7e6747a0ed", "ja": "別に、変じゃないと思うぞ。\n海美はアイドルなんだから、キラキラしてなくちゃな。", "zh": "我不觉得奇怪啊。\n海美，你是个偶像，本来就该耀眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "f3745218f65e1894f3a26d03920ee318545b4536e1720ebe69b66a302b159f46", "ja": "そうだけど、なんか……\nでも、そっか。私、キラキラしてたんだ……。", "zh": "是这么说没错，但好像……\n不过，这样啊。原来我刚刚很耀眼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d0a4f8496d7a5e0c81bc113dbbd0dfc41e7708d832dfa1a6fec80f3f9c26bb5e", "ja": "ああ、すごくいいステージだったよ。\n本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "是啊，是场非常棒的表演。\n真的辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1014_p", "source_sha256": "40f8440cfc7fe865e584b1d0aa88ff38d5f52d542c081b2e5582143aff2f1a40", "ja": "海美、汗で体が冷えたりしてないか？\n控え室に温かい飲み物があるから、温まるといい。", "zh": "海美，你流了汗，会不会觉得冷？\n准备室有热饮，去暖暖身子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "271d9402efd3372b3e65850cf42b8fb763baa2a2974e3c99d05a64225b4b956b", "ja": "うん！\nありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "f3f6cbe0a299f37feb008a4acf1261eff6e3ad59c7efd49c91318182be52e08e", "ja": "でもなんか、今、ふわふわ～ってしてて、\nあんまり寒くないかも……えへへ♪", "zh": "不过我现在觉得轻飘飘的～\n好像不太冷耶……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "6f0b0fbd3e16089e56a319dd093c65f4b42776ad430a177e3cb0fc5b58340e3a", "ja": "ね、{$P$}。私、体力には自信が\nあるし……こういうライブ、もっとやってみたい！", "zh": "对了，{$P$}。\n我对自己的体力很有信心……我想多办几次这种演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "b7da8137dfcfc95735c10a04e80d4958e7918525f918fbdbf19fc11f1a469d16", "ja": "春は桜でしょ？　夏は海で、秋は紅葉……\nうん、どんな季節でも絶対楽しいよねっ！", "zh": "春天的主题就是樱花吧？夏天是大海、秋天是枫叶……\n嗯，不管哪个季节，一定都会很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1019_p", "source_sha256": "74da77288eedac4e318a703be9db1dc1a0347255f4ad770d808f90d616be078d", "ja": "はは、そうだな。それじゃ、\n次のステージに向けて、準備を始めようか！", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。\n那么就开始为下一场表演做准备吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0054_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "58624ee7334a1d220708b87068f6962d49469d842ea10a6122598bddce237df1", "ja": "うん！　えへへ、楽しみ～。{$P$}、\n私、またキラキラできるように頑張るね！", "zh": "好！嘿嘿，好期待喔～{$P$}，\n我会好好加油，希望能继续在台上闪耀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
